WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
Picture the Lantern Bay

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.980
Council about to vote

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.300
on Harbor Walk.

4
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.840
Here's the deal

5
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.060
on the table.

6
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.660
The public offers support,

7
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.000
in return, the project

8
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.890
promises affordable homes.

9
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.000
But a promise

10
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.960
is only as clear

11
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.260
