25
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.110
That's called a remedy.

26
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:33.840
When all seven are

27
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.160
answered in writing,

28
00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.040
everyone can see

29
00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:36.930
what was agreed.

